## Third-party components (not covered by the MIT license above)

This repository is the Git form of Vector Software Integration Package (SIP)
CBD1800284 D00 (FBL FCA SLP5 for Nexteer, Renesas RH850). The following parts
remain governed by their own license terms and are NOT relicensed under MIT:

- All files under `BSW/` carrying a Vector Informatik GmbH copyright header
  (MICROSAR basic software and Flash Bootloader sources).
- `Demo/` template sources derived from Vector example code, where the Vector
  header is retained.
- `DaVinciConfigurator/`, `Generators/`, `MakeSupport/`, `Misc/HexView/`,
  `FlashTool/` tooling and binaries.
- All original documents under `Doc/` (PDF/HTML/CHM) and the structured
  Markdown conversions under `docs/` (the conversions document proprietary
  Vector content; the originals remain authoritative).
- License parameters in `SipLicense.lic`; the beta disclaimer in
  `BetaDisclaimer.txt`.

See `README.md` ("Vector vs. custom") and `docs/sip/` for the per-module
origin classification.
